+## CORS
+
+The totem web build runs on a local static server, so `api/*` answers CORS
+for `http(s)://localhost[:port]` and `http(s)://127.0.0.1[:port]` plus one
+optional configured origin (`TOTEM_WEB_ORIGIN`), and sends **no**
+`Access-Control-Allow-Origin` for any other origin. A preflight `OPTIONS
+api/totem/auth` from `http://localhost:8081` gets `204` with
+`Access-Control-Allow-Origin: http://localhost:8081`. No credentials.
+Implemented in `App\Http\Middleware\TotemCors`, which replaces the
+framework's allow-all CORS handler.
 
