+Device authentication is represented by the `totems` model plus
+`totem_presets` / `totem_preset_queue` (pairing bundles and queue scope).
+Pairing opens via `totem:pairing-code {preset}` and completes at `POST
+api/totem/auth`; every later call re-validates the token, the totem, the
+preset and the entity match server-side. The API must never trust a
+client-provided entity, queue ownership, price, ticket priority, or payment
+state without server-side validation.
 
